{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless hallways. Uneasy silence. A loop you can't escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backroom Loop is a first-person psychological horror exploration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in a space that's both unfamiliar and strangely familiar.<br>No matter how hard you try to escape, you always end up back where you started.<br>Is there truly an exit to this never-ending loop?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the Game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the internet myth &quot;Backrooms&quot; and the trending game &quot;Exit 8&quot;,<br>Backroom Loop blends observation, memory, and puzzle-solving into a strange yet captivating experience.<br>Each run offers something new \u2014 unexpected changes hidden in familiar spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 69 random events, making each playthrough unique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed pacing with no pressure \u2014 perfect for any mood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occasional mild jump scares \u2014 stay alert to your surroundings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports checkpoints and autosaves \u2014 resume anytime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete game experience lasts around 15\u201360 minutes \u2014 short yet enjoyable</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tips:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is full of hidden secrets and subtle details.<br>Don\u2019t rush to the ending \u2014 you might find something oddly familiar around the next corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Btw<br> my English level to bad so this\u00a0above by chatgpt\u00a0translate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br><br><br><br>hope you enjoy BACKROOM LOOP=]<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672540/e